<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="CGF1_MWP_AssaultRifle_T1">
		<defName>CGF1_MWP_Type81_</defName>
		<label>Type 81</label>
		<description>Caliber: 7.62x39mm. 30-round detachable mag. Select-Fire.
		
The Type 81 is a Chinese assault rifle developed in the 1970s and 80s in an attempt to replace the AK-derived Type 56 then in standard service. Relying on experiences from the Sino-Vietnamese border conflicts, the PLA wanted a weapon that had a longer service life than the Type 56 and one that could be produced using machine tooling for both the SKS and AK, which ultimately meant the Type 81 became a hybrid of those rifles' mechanics. The Type 81 is also somewhat lighter than the Type 56. The weapons served as the standard PLA arm for approximately 20 years, only beginning to be replaced in the late 90s by the QBZ-95.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>CGF1/Gun/Type81</texPath>
			<drawSize>1.00</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers>
				<li>CGF1_MWP_Building_Gunsmith</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisite>CGF1_MWP_Research_T9_SpaceAgeFirearms</researchPrerequisite>
			<skillRequirements>
				<Crafting>5</Crafting>
			</skillRequirements>
		</recipeMaker>
		<costList>
			<Steel>60</Steel>
			<ComponentIndustrial>7</ComponentIndustrial>
		</costList>
		<statBases>
			<WorkToMake>40000</WorkToMake>
			<Mass>3.4</Mass>
			<AccuracyTouch>0.60</AccuracyTouch>
			<AccuracyShort>0.60</AccuracyShort>
			<AccuracyMedium>0.55</AccuracyMedium>
			<AccuracyLong>0.50</AccuracyLong>
			<RangedWeapon_Cooldown>1.7</RangedWeapon_Cooldown>
		</statBases>
		<equippedAngleOffset>40</equippedAngleOffset>
		<weaponTags>
			<li>CGF1_AR_Military</li>
		</weaponTags>
		<tradeTags>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam</li>
			<li>CGF1_GunsGalore_ColdWarChinaVietnam_AR</li>
		</tradeTags>
		<verbs>
			<li>
				<verbClass>Verb_Shoot</verbClass>
				<hasStandardCommand>true</hasStandardCommand>
				<defaultProjectile>CGF1_MWP_Bullet_762x39mm_Auto</defaultProjectile>
				<warmupTime>1</warmupTime>
				<range>30.9</range>
				<burstShotCount>4</burstShotCount>
				<ticksBetweenBurstShots>7</ticksBetweenBurstShots>
				<soundCast>CGF1_GG_SFXR_Rifle2</soundCast>
				<soundCastTail>GunTail_Medium</soundCastTail>
				<muzzleFlashScale>9</muzzleFlashScale>
			</li>
		</verbs>
		<tools>
			<li>
				<label>stock</label>
				<capacities>
					<li>Blunt</li>
				</capacities>
				<power>10</power>
				<cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
			</li>
			<li>
				<label>barrel</label>
				<capacities>
					<li>Blunt</li>
					<li>Poke</li>
				</capacities>
				<power>9</power>
				<cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
			</li>
		</tools>
		<modExtensions>
			<li Class="MuzzleFlash.MuzzleFlashProps" MayRequire="issaczhuang.muzzleflash">
				<def>MF_StandardMuzzleFalsh</def>
				<drawSize>(0.8,0.8)</drawSize>
				<offsets>
					<li>(0.55,0.07)</li>
				</offsets>
			</li>
		</modExtensions>
		<generateCommonality>0.5</generateCommonality> <!-- Abundant -->
	</ThingDef>
	
